<title>HONG KONG: SOCCER-CHELSEA WIN FRIENDLY IN HONG KONG.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHELSEA WIN FRIENDLY IN HONG KONG.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>English F.A. Cup winners Chelsea beat South China 3-2 in an exhibition match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Chelsea - Gianluca Vialli 37, 40, Roberto di Matteo 43.</p>
<p>South China - Shum Kwok-pui 71, Ricky Cheng 90.</p>
</text>
